<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 10,680 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 5,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  166   (171 and 136)</p>
<p>    Good		155   (165 and 125)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     145   (150 and 116)</p>
<p>    Medium	    140   (142 and 108)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 90   ( 92 and  85)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 166 pence for an Kenya PF.1</p>
</text>
